      <p class="feature-spotlight__copy">
        Build a custom dataset on demand. Pick the fields you need — SSN,
        credit card, IBAN, NPI, driver's license, passport, EU VAT, and
        more — set a row count, optionally seed for reproducibility, and
        export as CSV. Useful when the library doesn't match the schema you
